				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">most freq. in Col.): scrobs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spatia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 30, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">humus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					2, 2, 21</span></i>
			 Gesn. and Schneid. <i>N. cr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latitudo,</span>”
