					5, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 2, 28</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pastinatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 20, 32, § 143</span></i>
			.</div>
